  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "We really need a MUCH better way to list group banned players. Right now you can only view in thumbnail form which makes looking through the list much more difficult. We need the following additions please:\n\n1. Ability to put in list form instead of thumbnail\n\n2. Ability to sort by most recent/oldest added as well as alphabetical.\n\n3. Would be nice if the page would load back to same location when going back. Currently it goes back to page one each time you are done viewing a player which makes it difficult when looking through several pages one by one.\n\n4. There needs to be a counter for total number of people added to banned list.\n\n5. It would also be great if we could add notes to people when they are banned (and those notes be visible in the list format)",
